{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ADxyBJVHYN5RcZqmVb8yGR","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 policy_ambiguity_safety 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (6 个)\\n\\n- **plan_009**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan_006**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan_005**: DONE (success) — \\n- **plan_002**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **diag_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- plan_009（准备中）\\n- plan_006（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **plan_005** (success): Specification-layer ambiguities produce qualitatively different failure modes (more assumption_based_action) than linguistic-layer ambiguities (more scope_misapplication), and coreferential's low violation rate is explained by higher conservative_refusal rate. These distinct failure mode profiles explain the layer hierarchy (spec ~46pp vs ling ~27pp). ← 基于 plan_002\\n  [plan_005_failure_modes](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/plan_005/data/failure_modes.jsonl) | [plan_005_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/plan_005/report/summary.json)\\n- **plan_002** (negative): Policy ambiguity causes significantly higher agent safety violation rates (+30-40pp) across all 6 ambiguity types, with uniform effect size across types (no significant type×violation interaction). Binary effect is the primary finding; type uniformity supports that ambiguity per se, not specific linguistic structures, drives violations.\\n  [plan_002 full study results](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/plan_002/data/full_statistics.json)\\n- **diag_001** (negative): Specification-layer 歧义（conditional precedence）比 linguistic-layer 歧义（scopal）导致更高的 agent 安全违规率，差异≥15pp 且 pairwise 显著。机制：规则冲突需要 agent 做隐式优先级假设，这种推理比句法解析更容易出错。 ← 基于 mvp_001\\n  [clause_templates_diag001](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/diag_001/data/clause_templates_diag001.json)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 4\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\n（无服务器配置）\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfVMdUwwyWMUd2tPji7Rcn","session_id":"76ddfd1b-00aa-4ce7-9ebb-7e9f774b92d6","uuid":"14b67b5a-2213-4bd2-b547-70039f9d003d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:37:35.169Z"}
