{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016yzcJsTn5vxotgu9ydGiUQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 21\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 设计：3 类歧义 × 2 API 模型验证 type effect，不用 GPU\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是\\\\\\\"歧义类型影响安全违规率\\\\\\\"。选 scopal/lexical/incompleteness 3 种假设差异最大的类型，用 frontier\\\\n    API 模型（免 GPU）快速验证信号存在性。60 条款 × 2 variants × 2 模型 = 240 runs，统计功效足够（χ² df=2, medium\\\\n    effect w=0.3, N=240 >> 所需 ~107）。Pass 条件：p<0.05 + V≥0.15。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 3 条修正：增条款数、调阈值、补 fail path\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: (1) pairwise N=80 对 V=0.15 功效仅 0.22，增至 30 条款/类（pairwise\\\\n    N=120）+ 提阈值至 V≥0.20 + 明确 MVP 只检测 medium+ effect；(2) 补 fail path 三级决策树（扩大N重测 →\\\\n    pivot binary story → full study）；(3) 加 judge 偏差检查点（scopal 低于预期时先排查 judge bias）。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: ROADMAP 补充 H1-H4 预测基准和 post-MVP 18 周路径骨架\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: (1) ROADMAP 缺 post-MVP 骨架，ICLR DDL 18 周后，需提前规划 GPU\\\\n    申请时间点（W3 MVP pass 后立即申请，W5 开始 Phase 2b）；(2) H1-H4 方向性预测未落地到 ROADMAP，Agent 解读 MVP\\\\n    结果时需对照基准（H1: scopal 最高，H2: lexical 最低，null: binary effect story）。paper_framing.md\\\\n    保持在 MVP 后创建。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 分析改为双轨：ambiguous-only 跨类型比较（主）+ matched-pair within-type（辅）\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: incompleteness matched pair 存在信息量不对称混淆——消歧必然添加信息，与\\\\n    scopal/lexical 的\\\\\\\"同信息不同措辞\\\\\\\"baseline 不可比。解法：(1) 主分析用 ambiguous-only 条件直接跨类型比较违规率（不受信息量混淆）；(2)\\\\n    matched-pair 降为辅助的 within-type 效应量度量；(3) 要求 Agent 修订 incompleteness pairs 只添加解决歧义的最小信息；(4)\\\\n    效度边界显式声明此不对称性。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 使用 τ²-bench + 剥离 tool description 中的策略信息\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: 需在 injection pipeline 前决定版本和 tool description 处理。选\\\\n    τ²-bench 因为 NL assertions 适合安全违规评估（v1 的 DB hash 太僵硬）。Tool description 中的策略信息会造成信息泄漏（agent\\\\n    绕过歧义策略从 tool desc 获取正确信息），选择剥离而非同步修改——更简单且信号更纯净。Airline 补偿条款可作为 scopal ambiguity\\\\n    paired pairs 起点。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 08:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 目标会议从 ICLR 2027 切换至 EMNLP 2026（ARR Aug cycle）\\\\n  rationale: 用户指令 /venue emnlp-2026。DDL 从 Sep 24 (18 周) 压缩到 ~Aug 3 (10.5 周)。Post-MVP\\\\n    Phase 2 规模缩减（500 条款 vs 1000），时间窗压紧。EMNLP 2026 long paper 8 页 + unlimited refs，通过\\\\n    ARR 统一审稿。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: EMNLP 适配：保 6 类型、砍模型 6→4、砍条款 500→300、Phase 3 降级 PoC、CL-first 叙事\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer venue 影响评估：(1) EMNLP 比 ICLR 更适合本文（两条腿：语言学分析+实证安全），但需 CL-first\\\\n    framing（从 ambiguity detection/resolution 文献入手，safety 是 application context）；(2)\\\\n    6 类型是核心贡献不可砍，模型 6→4（2 API+2 开源）省 1/3 GPU、条款 500→300（50/type, pairwise N=200 power>0.9）边际收益小但成本线性、Phase\\\\n    3 降为 PoC 省 1 周给 error analysis；(3) 最终 2400 episodes 完全可行；(4) 8 页 fitting 需压 Related\\\\n    Work ≤1 页、taxonomy 用 table、per-model breakdown 放 appendix；(5) ARR 滚动机制是安全网（Aug\\\\n    不完美可改投 Oct→NAACL/ACL 2027）。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Taxonomy 采用 2-layer 结构（3 linguistic + 3 specification）；开源模型定为 Qwen3-8B\\\\n    + Qwen3-32B(int4)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 3 份审查综合：(1) Taxonomy: authorization scope 在 CL 传统中是 vagueness\\\\n    非 ambiguity，conditional precedence 是规范冲突非语言学歧义——2-layer 分类（linguistic: scopal/lexical/coreferential\\\\n    + specification: incompleteness/conditional precedence/authorization scope）比扁平\\\\n    6 类更诚实、对 EMNLP 审稿人更有防御力；需加 ambiguity-vagueness 操作性定义声明（ref Wasow 2005）；(2) 硬件:\\\\n    RTX PRO 6000 48GB 上 DeepSeek-V3 不可行、Qwen3-32B 需 int4，可行组合 Qwen3-8B(bf16 16GB)\\\\n    + Qwen3-32B(int4 ~18GB)，同家族不同 scale 可做 scale analysis；(3) API model ID 20260620\\\\n    是未来日期需验证。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: API 阻塞解除：ECONNREFUSED 是 WebFetch 代理问题，端点从本机可达，MVP 可启动\\\\n  rationale: 用户确认 http://47.94.22.126/v1 从 AWS 本机直连正常（curl 返回 401 要求 auth header）。之前\\\\n    Worker 用 WebFetch 工具（走 Anthropic 海外代理）访问国内 IP 被拒。后续涉及国内 IP 的操作必须用 Bash curl。MVP\\\\n    唯一阻塞项消除，指令 Agent 立即验证端点 + 启动 360 episodes。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 改用 gpt-5.4 + gpt-4.1（端点无 Claude），立即启动\\\\n  rationale: 端点 47.94.22.126 是纯 OpenAI 代理，无 Anthropic 模型。MVP 目标是检测 type effect 信号非跨厂商泛化。gpt-5.4\\\\n    + gpt-4.1 提供同厂不同代际对比，交叉 judge 可行（gpt-5.4 ep → gpt-4.1 judge，反之亦然）。统计功效充足（180 ambiguous\\\\n    ep, 60/type, omnibus power>0.95）。Claude 留 full study 做跨厂商验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP FAIL on type effect → pivot to binary anchor + diagnostic for layer\\\\n    effect + full study\\\\n  rationale: MVP 结果：type effect p=0.50 V=0.084（FAIL），binary effect +35-42pp p<1e-5（极强）。V=0.084\\\\n    远低于阈值，扩 N 无意义（Fail path L1 跳过）。决策：(1) binary effect 作为论文主 claim 锚点——\\\\\\\"歧义策略导致大规模安全违规\\\\\\\"；(2)\\\\n    跑 diagnostic：conditional precedence（specification layer, 预测最高违规率）vs scopal（linguistic\\\\n    layer 最高），N=50/type，验证 2-layer 之间是否有 type effect；(3) 无论 diagnostic 结果如何都进 full\\\\n    study——binary effect 本身已 justify；(4) full study 中 type analysis 改为 exploratory（effect\\\\n    size + error analysis），不作为 confirmatory primary claim。符合 IDEA_BRIEF null-result\\\\n    预承诺：\\\\\\\"binary detection may suffice\\\\\\\"。CL-first 叙事不变——error analysis 是 EMNLP 核心期待。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: type_effect_fail_binary_pass\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: Full study 新增 model×type interaction 作为正式分析维度\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 mvp_001 发现 gpt-5.4 scopal 60% vs lexical 40%（20pp gap, H1\\\\n    方向），而 gpt-4.1 完全扁平（40-47%）。\\\\\\\"Type sensitivity 作为 model capability 的函数\\\\\\\"比单纯 type\\\\n    effect 更有深度，更适合 EMNLP。Full study 4 模型（2 API 不同代际 + 2 开源不同规模）× 6 类型可正式检验交互效应。同时论文报告\\\\n    unambiguous baseline 违规率 ~8%（14/180），净歧义效应 ~34-44pp。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: model_type_interaction_signal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 11:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'diag_001 FAIL: layer effect 不存在，C3 死亡。Paper framing 确认 binary anchor +\\\\n    type uniformity null + visibility insight'\\\\n  rationale: diag_001 结果：CP 34% vs scopal 40%，Δ=-6pp（方向相反），p=0.464。结合 mvp_001（层内无差异\\\\n    p=0.50），两轮实验收敛：歧义对 agent 安全的影响与类型完全无关（uniform effect）。C3（layer effect）正式死亡。但 Reviewer\\\\n    发现有价值的 CL insight：CP < scopal 可能因为显式规则冲突对模型 \\\\\\\"可见\\\\\\\"（meta-cognitive awareness），而语法歧义\\\\n    \\\\\\\"隐形\\\\\\\"。Full study 中若复现，可作为论文讨论亮点。test-retest 波动 ±8pp 需要 full study 加 bootstrap CI。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: diag_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: CP 34% vs scopal 40%, p=0.464, layer effect FAIL'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 'negative: type effect p=0.50, binary effect +35-42pp'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream dream_20260520T112859 分析完成：best 3.5 / median 3.0 / worst 2.5，threshold\\\\n    met (best≥3.5, median≥2.5)。12 条确认行动项已持久化到 framing+plan，6 条观察项记录待真实实验验证。批准 P0 实验启动。\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 三档评分满足 post-MVP kickoff 阈值（best≥weak accept 且 median≥borderline）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    确认行动项（已执行）：\\\\n\\\\n    A1: 标题从 \\\\\\\"All Ambiguity Is Nocuous\\\\\\\" 软化为 \\\\\\\"Policy Ambiguity Is Uniformly Nocuous\\\\\\\"（三档一致\\\\n    overclaim 反馈）\\\\n\\\\n    A2: 引用列表扩展要求（≥25 篇，补 good-enough processing/instruction-following/prompt sensitivity/garden-path\\\\n    等）\\\\n\\\\n    A3: C2/C3 增加 power analysis，报告 MDE\\\\n\\\\n    A4: TOST margin 双重检验（±15pp + ±10pp），显式 justify\\\\n\\\\n    A5: C3 明确标注 EXPLORATORY + post-diagnostic，p-value 需 caution\\\\n\\\\n    A6: Code/data release 承诺（clause pairs + eval scripts + analysis code + trace samples）\\\\n\\\\n    A7: plan_009 judge calibration P1→P0（best 档 \\\\\\\"single most critical missing validation\\\\\\\"）\\\\n\\\\n    A8: C2/C3 关系显式讨论（omnibus vs planned pairwise 答不同问题）\\\\n\\\\n    A9: 新增 RC11 prompt sensitivity confound + plan_010 perturbation control arm (P1)\\\\n\\\\n    A10: plan_004 增加 incompleteness information delta 量化\\\\n\\\\n    A11: 52% coreferential fix rate 作为 limitation 讨论\\\\n\\\\n    A12: 6 个必需 figure plan\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    观察项（等真实实验）：\\\\n\\\\n    O1: V trend — 如 V>0.20 则 C2 null rejected，需 worst-tier reframing\\\\n\\\\n    O2: Error analysis IAA — 如 κ<0.60 则 C5 降级为 supplementary\\\\n\\\\n    O3: Visibility p-value — 如 p>0.10 保持 exploratory，p<0.05 考虑升级\\\\n\\\\n    O4: Classifier F1 — 如<0.75 移入 appendix\\\\n\\\\n    O5: Realism validation KS — 如 2+ tests fail 需 length-matched subset\\\\n\\\\n    O6: Model×type interaction significance\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    忽略项（有理由）：\\\\n\\\\n    I1: Flat unambiguous baselines — median-only, imagined data artifact\\\\n\\\\n    I2: Page limit — writing phase处理\\\\n\\\\n    I3: r_s on n=4 — worst-only, 不会在实际论文中这么做\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    不需要 re-dream 的理由：变更均为 clarification/addition 而非结构性 framing 重构；评分已达标；核心 story（binary\\\\n    effect + uniformity null + visibility exploratory）未改变。Plan 变更为 priority 调整和 P1\\\\n    新增，不影响已有 P0 实验设计。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260520T112859\\\\n    role: dream simulation\\\\n    result: best 3.5 / median 3.0 / worst 2.5\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Coreferential Path A (三层修复): tool responses 泄漏消歧线索是 mini-pilot v2 FAIL\\\\n    根因，需修复 tool responses + scenario + 行为可区分性。plan_010 升 P0 并移到 plan_002/003 之前执行。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Mini-pilot v2 结果 1/5 (20%)，根因不是条款文本（已审计修复 26/50），而是 τ²-bench 框架层面的系统性问题：(1)\\\\n    tool responses 返回结构化字段直接消歧（如 explicit ages, wrong_item_received 状态），(2) 部分条款两种解读导致相同\\\\n    action，(3) 模型可通过保守策略避开歧义点。Reviewer 独立确认了 Agent 的根因分析。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    选择 Path A（修复）而非 B（缩减）或 C（降级），因为：\\\\n\\\\n    - 6 类型均衡是 taxonomy 核心结构\\\\n\\\\n    - 如果 coreferential 系统性偏低会产生伪 type effect，破坏 C2 (uniformity null)\\\\n\\\\n    - 2-3h worker 时间是 trivial 投入\\\\n\\\\n    - 修复方向正确（确保实验框架不 bias 特定类型）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    plan_010 升 P0 的理由（Reviewer warning）：如果 perturbation control 显示 prompt brittleness\\\\n    也导致 +30pp，则 full study 2,400 episodes 全部无效。先投入 30 pairs + 120 episodes 验证因果性，再投入大规模实验。成本-信息比极高。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001b\\\\n    role: mini-pilot v2\\\\n    result: FAIL 1/5 (20%)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: causal validation\\\\n    result: upgraded P1→P0, must run before plan_002/003\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_010 perturbation control: 5-tier judgment criteria adopted, CI-based\\\\n    over p-value, Δ_net as primary metric'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer assessment refined original 3-tier to 5-tier (PASS/PASS+caveat/CONDITIONAL/WARNING/FAIL)\\\\n    based on Δ_perturb/Δ_ambiguity ratio. Key insight: N=120 has only ~30% power for\\\\n    10pp difference, so CI width is the decision metric, not p-value. If CI >15pp\\\\n    width, expand N by 60 episodes. Primary metric is Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb\\\\n    (net ambiguity-specific effect). Also added contingency framing to paper_framing.md\\\\n    for scenarios where full study deviates from MVP (2/6 types fail → differential\\\\n    nocuity pivot; uniformity rejected → type hierarchy pivot).'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: judgment criteria defined\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claude Sonnet 4.6 added as 5th model via OpenRouter proxy, plan_002 expanded\\\\n    to 1,800 episodes, plan_010 to 180 episodes\\\\n  rationale: 'Distill gap: 4/8 peer papers use Claude baseline, our plan had 0 Claude\\\\n    models. User provided API key for OpenRouter proxy (base_url=http://47.94.22.126/v1).\\\\n    Claude Sonnet 4.6 chosen as comparable to gpt-4.1 tier, cost-effective for 600\\\\n    additional episodes. Total model coverage now 5 models × 3 families (OpenAI/Anthropic/Qwen),\\\\n    addressing RC from distilled literature. API cost increase ~$100 (50% of plan_002),\\\\n    justified by closing the most significant baseline gap.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: expanded\\\\n    result: 3 API models\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: expanded\\\\n    result: 3 API models\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_010 PASS (Δ_perturb=0pp, verdict=PASS), plan_002 approved for immediate\\\\n    launch with 2 API models\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_010 perturbation control: 120 episodes, all violation_level=none.\\\\n    Synonym substitution and clause reordering produce zero violations across both\\\\n    models. Δ_perturb=0pp vs ambiguity Δ=38pp → ratio=0.0, strongest possible PASS.\\\\n    Causal claim fully validated: the +38pp effect is entirely ambiguity-specific,\\\\n    not general prompt brittleness. plan_002 all prerequisites met: 300 clauses ready,\\\\n    pipeline code complete, perturbation control passed. Launching with gpt-5.4 +\\\\n    gpt-4.1 (1,200 episodes); Claude 600 episodes deferred until endpoint resolved.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: PASS, Δ_perturb=0pp\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: launching 1,200 episodes\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_010 v2 PASS (real data): Δ_perturb=3.33pp, CI=[-5,13.33] contains\\\\n    0, ratio=8.8%. plan_002 re-approved.'\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_010 v2 with fixed code (preflight + validation + error guard).\\\\n    120 real episodes with actual agent responses. Δ_perturb=3.33pp < 5pp threshold,\\\\n    CI contains 0, ratio=0.088 < 0.15 → PASS (strongest form). CI width 18.33pp >\\\\n    15pp flagged as underpowered but not actionable: even CI upper bound (13.33pp)\\\\n    gives Δ_net=24.67pp, far exceeding 20pp threshold. Causal claim validated: ambiguity-specific\\\\n    effect confirmed. D018 superseded (was based on fake data). plan_002 re-approved\\\\n    for immediate launch.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: PASS, Δ=3.33pp real data\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: re-approved\\\\n    result: launching 1,200 episodes\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 15:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Major framing pivot: \\\\\\\"Uniform Nocuity\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"Differential Nocuity\\\\\\\" after\\\\n    C2 falsified (V=0.207). Layer hierarchy confirmed: Spec ~46pp >> Ling ~27pp.'\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_002 (1,200 episodes) falsified C2 type uniformity: omnibus χ²=25.61,\\\\n    p=0.0001, V=0.207. Clear layer hierarchy: specification-layer avg Δ≈46pp (auth_scope\\\\n    53pp, incompleteness 49pp, CP 35pp) vs linguistic-layer avg Δ≈27pp (scopal 36pp,\\\\n    lexical 30pp, coreferential 16pp). This matches pre-planned Contingency Scenario\\\\n    C. Framing pivoted: title, core insight, C2 (null→positive), C3 (visibility→layer\\\\n    effect), concept naming (Uniform→Differential Nocuity + Disambiguation Channel\\\\n    Hypothesis), narrative structure, RC1 updated. This is a STRONGER paper — type\\\\n    hierarchy with linguistic explanation is more informative than uniform null. Re-dream\\\\n    recommended to validate new framing.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: C1 confirmed +36.5pp, C2 FALSIFIED V=0.207\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: superseded\\\\n    result: C2 null was artifact of 3-type coincidence\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 14699, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012pTdZnvTNNyM9GXAiuL8Hr","session_id":"76ddfd1b-00aa-4ce7-9ebb-7e9f774b92d6","uuid":"2770df47-a691-415f-b00b-b87bb6fcc267","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:38:15.215Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ppRKrrZudKJDT1vx29HuL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2\t\"\"\"Agent Execution Harness for policy ambiguity safety experiments.\n3\t\n4\tRuns LLM agents against ambiguous/unambiguous policy clauses and records\n5\tfull conversation trajectories for downstream evaluation.\n6\t\"\"\"\n7\t\n8\timport argparse\n9\timport asyncio\n10\timport json\n11\timport os\n12\timport sys\n13\timport time\n14\timport uuid\n15\tfrom pathlib import Path\n16\tfrom typing import Any\n17\t\n18\timport config\n19\t\n20\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n21\t# Provider clients (lazy-initialized)\n22\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n23\t\n24\t_anthropic_client = None\n25\t_openai_client = None\n26\t\n27\t\n28\tdef _get_anthropic_client():\n29\t    global _anthropic_client\n30\t    if _anthropic_client is None:\n31\t        import anthropic\n32\t        _anthropic_client = anthropic.AsyncAnthropic(\n33\t            api_key=[REDACTED]"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\"]\n34\t        )\n35\t    return _anthropic_client\n36\t\n37\t\n38\tdef _get_openai_client():\n39\t    global _openai_client\n40\t    if _openai_client is None:\n41\t        import openai\n42\t        _openai_client = openai.AsyncOpenAI(\n43\t            api_key=[REDACTED]"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]\n44\t        )\n45\t    return _openai_client\n46\t\n47\t\n48\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n49\t# Clause loading\n50\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n51\t\n52\tdef load_clauses(path: str) -> list[dict]:\n53\t    \"\"\"Load clause definitions from JSON.\n54\t\n55\t    Expected schema per clause:\n56\t    {\n57\t        \"clause_id\": \"S01\",\n58\t        \"ambiguity_type\": \"scopal|lexical|incompleteness\",\n59\t        \"ambiguous_clause\": \"...\",\n60\t        \"unambiguous_clause\": \"...\",\n61\t        \"user_scenario\": \"...\",\n62\t        \"tools\": [...],              # optional tool definitions\n63\t        \"stripped_tool_desc\": [...]   # tool defs with info stripped from descriptions\n64\t    }\n65\t    \"\"\"\n66\t    with open(path) as f:\n67\t        clauses = json.load(f)\n68\t    if isinstance(clauses, dict) and \"clauses\" in clauses:\n69\t        clauses = clauses[\"clauses\"]\n70\t    return clauses\n71\t\n72\t\n73\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n74\t# System prompt construction\n75\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n76\t\n77\tdef build_system_prompt(clause_text: str) -> str:\n78\t    return config.SYSTEM_PROMPT_TEMPLATE.format(\n79\t        agent_instruction=config.AGENT_INSTRUCTION,\n80\t        policy_clause=clause_text,\n81\t    )\n82\t\n83\t\n84\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n85\t# Provider-specific agent calls\n86\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n87\t\n88\tasync def _call_anthropic(\n89\t    model_cfg: dict,\n90\t    system_prompt: str,\n91\t    messages: list[dict],\n92\t    tools: list[dict] | None,\n93\t) -> dict:\n94\t    client = _get_anthropic_client()\n95\t    kwargs: dict[str, Any] = {\n96\t        \"model\": model_cfg[\"model_id\"],\n97\t        \"max_tokens\": model_cfg[\"max_tokens\"],\n98\t        \"system\": system_prompt,\n99\t        \"messages\": messages,\n100\t    }\n101\t    if tools:\n102\t        kwargs[\"tools\"] = [\n103\t            {\n104\t                \"name\": t[\"function\"][\"name\"],\n105\t                \"description\": t[\"function\"].get(\"description\", \"\"),\n106\t                \"input_schema\": t[\"function\"].get(\"parameters\", {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}}),\n107\t            }\n108\t            for t in tools\n109\t        ]\n110\t    response = await client.messages.create(**kwargs)\n111\t\n112\t    assistant_text = \"\"\n113\t    tool_calls = []\n114\t    for block in response.content:\n115\t        if block.type == \"text\":\n116\t            assistant_text += block.text\n117\t        elif block.type == \"tool_use\":\n118\t            tool_calls.append({\n119\t                \"id\": block.id,\n120\t                \"name\": block.name,\n121\t                \"arguments\": block.input,\n122\t            })\n123\t    return {\n124\t        \"role\": \"assistant\",\n125\t        \"content\": assistant_text,\n126\t        \"tool_calls\": tool_calls,\n127\t        \"stop_reason\": response.stop_reason,\n128\t    }\n129\t\n130\t\n131\tasync def _call_openai(\n132\t    model_cfg: dict,\n133\t    system_prompt: str,\n134\t    messages: list[dict],\n135\t    tools: list[dict] | None,\n136\t) -> dict:\n137\t    client = _get_openai_client()\n138\t    full_messages = [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": system_prompt}] + messages\n139\t    kwargs: dict[str, Any] = {\n140\t        \"model\": model_cfg[\"model_id\"],\n141\t        \"max_tokens\": model_cfg[\"max_tokens\"],\n142\t        \"messages\": full_messages,\n143\t    }\n144\t    if tools:\n145\t        kwargs[\"tools\"] = tools\n146\t    response = await client.chat.completions.create(**kwargs)\n147\t    choice = response.choices[0]\n148\t    msg = choice.message\n149\t\n150\t    tool_calls = []\n151\t    if msg.tool_calls:\n152\t        for tc in msg.tool_calls:\n153\t            tool_calls.append({\n154\t                \"id\": tc.id,\n155\t                \"name\": tc.function.name,\n156\t                \"arguments\": json.loads(tc.function.arguments) if isinstance(tc.function.arguments, str) else tc.function.arguments,\n157\t            })\n158\t    return {\n159\t        \"role\": \"assistant\",\n160\t        \"content\": msg.content or \"\",\n161\t        \"tool_calls\": tool_calls,\n162\t        \"stop_reason\": choice.finish_reason,\n163\t    }\n164\t\n165\t\n166\tasync def call_agent(\n167\t    model_name: str,\n168\t    system_prompt: str,\n169\t    messages: list[dict],\n170\t    tools: list[dict] | None = None,\n171\t) -> dict:\n172\t    model_cfg = config.MODELS[model_name]\n173\t    if model_cfg[\"provider\"] == \"anthropic\":\n174\t        return await _call_anthropic(model_cfg, system_prompt, messages, tools)\n175\t    elif model_cfg[\"provider\"] == \"openai\":\n176\t        return await _call_openai(model_cfg, system_prompt, messages, tools)\n177\t    else:\n178\t        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown provider: {model_cfg['provider']}\")\n179\t\n180\t\n181\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n182\t# Single episode execution\n183\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n184\t\n185\tMAX_TURNS = 10\n186\t\n187\t\n188\tasync def run_episode(\n189\t    clause: dict,\n190\t    condition: str,  # \"ambiguous\" or \"unambiguous\"\n191\t    model_name: str,\n192\t) -> dict:\n193\t    \"\"\"Run a single agent episode and return the full trajectory.\"\"\"\n194\t    clause_text = clause[f\"{condition}_clause\"]\n195\t    system_prompt = build_system_prompt(clause_text)\n196\t    tools = clause.get(\"stripped_tool_desc\") or clause.get(\"tools\")\n197\t\n198\t    trajectory: list[dict] = []\n199\t    messages: list[dict] = []\n200\t\n201\t    user_msg = {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": clause[\"user_scenario\"]}\n202\t    messages.append(user_msg)\n203\t    trajectory.append(user_msg)\n204\t\n205\t    for _turn in range(MAX_TURNS):\n206\t        try:\n207\t            response = await call_agent(model_name, system_prompt, messages, tools)\n208\t        except Exception as e:\n209\t            trajectory.append({\"role\": \"error\", \"content\": str(e)})\n210\t            break\n211\t\n212\t        trajectory.append(response)\n213\t\n214\t        if response[\"tool_calls\"]:\n215\t            tool_results = []\n216\t            for tc in response[\"tool_calls\"]:\n217\t                tool_result = {\n218\t                    \"role\": \"tool\",\n219\t                    \"tool_call_id\": tc[\"id\"],\n220\t                    \"name\": tc[\"name\"],\n221\t                    \"content\": json.dumps({\"status\": \"simulated\", \"note\": \"Tool execution simulated for safety evaluation\"}),\n222\t                }\n223\t                tool_results.append(tool_result)\n224\t                trajectory.append(tool_result)\n225\t\n226\t            if config.MODELS[model_name][\"provider\"] == \"anthropic\":\n227\t                messages.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": response[\"content\"] if response[\"content\"] else None,\n228\t                                 \"tool_calls\": response[\"tool_calls\"]})\n229\t                for tr in tool_results:\n230\t                    messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [\n231\t                        {\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"tool_use_id\": tr[\"tool_call_id\"], \"content\": tr[\"content\"]}\n232\t                    ]})\n233\t            else:\n234\t                messages.append({\n235\t                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n236\t                    \"content\": response[\"content\"],\n237\t                    \"tool_calls\": [\n238\t                        {\"id\": tc[\"id\"], \"type\": \"function\",\n239\t                         \"function\": {\"name\": tc[\"name\"], \"arguments\": json.dumps(tc[\"arguments\"])}}\n240\t                        for tc in response[\"tool_calls\"]\n241\t                    ],\n242\t                })\n243\t                for tr in tool_results:\n244\t                    messages.append({\"role\": \"tool\", \"tool_call_id\": tr[\"tool_call_id\"], \"content\": tr[\"content\"]})\n245\t        else:\n246\t            if response.get(\"stop_reason\") in (\"end_turn\", \"stop\", None):\n247\t                break\n248\t            messages.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": response[\"content\"]})\n249\t\n250\t    return {\n251\t        \"episode_id\": str(uuid.uuid4()),\n252\t        \"clause_id\": clause[\"clause_id\"],\n253\t        \"ambiguity_type\": clause[\"ambiguity_type\"],\n254\t        \"condition\": condition,\n255\t        \"model\": model_name,\n256\t        \"system_prompt\": system_prompt,\n257\t        \"trajectory\": trajectory,\n258\t        \"timestamp\": time.time(),\n259\t    }\n260\t\n261\t\n262\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n263\t# Batch runner with concurrency + resume\n264\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n265\t\n266\tdef _load_completed(output_dir: Path) -> set[str]:\n267\t    \"\"\"Return set of (clause_id, condition, model) keys already completed.\"\"\"\n268\t    completed = set()\n269\t    for jsonl_file in output_dir.glob(\"*.jsonl\"):\n270\t        with open(jsonl_file) as f:\n271\t            for line in f:\n272\t                if line.strip():\n273\t                    rec = json.loads(line)\n274\t                    key = f\"{rec['clause_id']}|{rec['condition']}|{rec['model']}\"\n275\t                    completed.add(key)\n276\t    return completed\n277\t\n278\t\n279\tdef _episode_key(clause_id: str, condition: str, model: str) -> str:\n280\t    return f\"{clause_id}|{condition}|{model}\"\n281\t\n282\t\n283\tasync def run_all(\n284\t    clauses: list[dict],\n285\t    models: list[str],\n286\t    output_dir: Path,\n287\t    concurrency: int = config.DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY,\n288\t    resume: bool = True,\n289\t):\n290\t    output_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n291\t    completed = _load_completed(output_dir) if resume else set()\n292\t\n293\t    tasks = []\n294\t    for clause in clauses:\n295\t        for condition in (\"ambiguous\", \"unambiguous\"):\n296\t            for model in models:\n297\t                key = _episode_key(clause[\"clause_id\"], condition, model)\n298\t                if key in completed:\n299\t                    continue\n300\t                tasks.append((clause, condition, model))\n301\t\n302\t    if not tasks:\n303\t        print(\"All episodes already completed.\")\n304\t        return\n305\t\n306\t    print(f\"Running {len(tasks)} episodes (concurrency={concurrency})…\")\n307\t    semaphore = asyncio.Semaphore(concurrency)\n308\t    output_file = output_dir / \"episodes.jsonl\"\n309\t    lock = asyncio.Lock()\n310\t    done_count = 0\n311\t\n312\t    async def _run_one(clause, condition, model):\n313\t        nonlocal done_count\n314\t        async with semaphore:\n315\t            result = await run_episode(clause, condition, model)\n316\t            async with lock:\n317\t                with open(output_file, \"a\") as f:\n318\t                    f.write(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n319\t                done_count += 1\n320\t                if done_count % 10 == 0 or done_count == len(tasks):\n321\t                    print(f\"  [{done_count}/{len(tasks)}] completed\")\n322\t\n323\t    await asyncio.gather(\n324\t        *[_run_one(c, cond, m) for c, cond, m in tasks],\n325\t        return_exceptions=True,\n326\t    )\n327\t    print(f\"Done. Results written to {output_file}\")\n328\t\n329\t\n330\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n331\t# CLI\n332\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n333\t\n334\tdef parse_args(argv: list[str] | None = None) -> argparse.Namespace:\n335\t    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(\n336\t        description=\"Run agent episodes against ambiguous/unambiguous policy clauses.\"\n337\t    )\n338\t    parser.add_argument(\n339\t        \"--clauses\", required=True,\n340\t        help=\"Path to clauses JSON file.\",\n341\t    )\n342\t    parser.add_argument(\n343\t        \"--models\", default=\"claude-sonnet-4-5,gpt-5.4\",\n344\t        help=\"Comma-separated model names (default: claude-sonnet-4-5,gpt-5.4).\",\n345\t    )\n346\t    parser.add_argument(\n347\t        \"--output\", default=str(config.DEFAULT_OUTPUT_DIR),\n348\t        help=\"Output directory for episode results.\",\n349\t    )\n350\t    parser.add_argument(\n351\t        \"--concurrency\", type=int, default=config.DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY,\n352\t        help=f\"Max concurrent API calls (default: {config.DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY}).\",\n353\t    )\n354\t    parser.add_argument(\n355\t        \"--resume\", action=\"store_true\", default=True,\n356\t        help=\"Skip already-completed episodes (default: True).\",\n357\t    )\n358\t    parser.add_argument(\n359\t        \"--no-resume\", action=\"store_false\", dest=\"resume\",\n360\t        help=\"Re-run all episodes, ignoring previous results.\",\n361\t    )\n362\t    return parser.parse_args(argv)\n363\t\n364\t\n365\tdef main(argv: list[str] | None = None):\n366\t    args = parse_args(argv)\n367\t    clauses = load_clauses(args.clauses)\n368\t    models = [m.strip() for m in args.models.split(\",\")]\n369\t\n370\t    for m in models:\n371\t        if m not in config.MODELS:\n372\t            print(f\"Error: unknown model '{m}'. Available: {list(config.MODELS.keys())}\")\n373\t            sys.exit(1)\n374\t\n375\t    asyncio.run(run_all(\n376\t        clauses=clauses,\n377\t        models=models,\n378\t        output_dir=Path(args.output),\n379\t        concurrency=args.concurrency,\n380\t        resume=args.resume,\n381\t    ))\n382\t\n383\t\n384\tif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n385\t    main()\n386\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfVMdUwwyWMUd2tPji7Rcn","session_id":"76ddfd1b-00aa-4ce7-9ebb-7e9f774b92d6","uuid":"cfc25600-5442-4039-a5df-80a475cbe66a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:38:15.289Z"}
